ting `.acquire_image` for `rts5817maa` with its unit tests.\n* **Commit Message:** ❌ Remove the redundant `\"Add unit tests for...\"` paragraph and `\"This translates...\"` filler opener (see inline replacement on `/COMMIT_MSG`).\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/903e4fcd-0251-4c23-b245-b5856bb66f78)",
