      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] Three issues in `rts5817maa_acquire_image`:\n\n1. **Missing `NULL` buffer check \u0026 braces:** If `image \u003d\u003d NULL` is passed with `size \u003e\u003d CONFIG_FINGERPRINT_SENSOR_IMAGE_SIZE`, `NULL` is forwarded directly to `rts5817maa_sensor_acquire_image`. Validate `image \u003d\u003d NULL` alongside `size \u003c CONFIG_FINGERPRINT_SENSOR_IMAGE_SIZE` (matching `rts5817maa_get_info` above and `rts5817_spi_xfer` in `fingerprint_rts5817maa_pal.c`), and wrap the `if` body in braces `{ ... }` for consistency with Zephyr style and the rest of this file.\n2. **Diagnostic error code lost in `LOG_ERR`:** Wrapping `rts5817maa_sensor_acquire_image(...)` inside `convert_rts_get_image_error_code(...)` before logging collapses all sensor/SPI failures (`RTS_ERROR_IO_EXCEPTION`, `RTS_ERROR_TIMEOUT`, `RTS_ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER`) into `-EIO` (`-5`), so the log message loses the specific `rts_fp_return_t` failure code returned by the library. Capture the raw `rts_fp_return_t` status first and log it on failure (matching `rts5817maa_get_info` on lines 176–180).\n\n```c\nstatic int rts5817maa_acquire_image(const struct device *dev,\n\t\t\t\t    enum fingerprint_capture_type capture_type,\n\t\t\t\t    uint8_t *image, size_t size)\n{\n\tif (image \u003d\u003d NULL || size \u003c CONFIG_FINGERPRINT_SENSOR_IMAGE_SIZE) {\n\t\treturn -EINVAL;\n\t}\n\n\trts_capture_mode_t rts_capture_mode \u003d\n\t\tconvert_fp_capture_type_to_rts_capture_type(capture_type);\n\n\tif (rts_capture_mode \u003d\u003d RTS_CAPTURE_TYPE_INVALID) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"Unsupported capture_type %d provided\", capture_type);\n\t\treturn -EINVAL;\n\t}\n\n\tif (!IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_HAVE_RTS5817MAA_PRIVATE_DRIVER)) {\n\t\treturn -ENOTSUP;\n\t}\n\n\trts_fp_return_t res \u003d\n\t\trts5817maa_sensor_acquire_image(image, rts_capture_mode);\n\tif (res !\u003d RTS_FP_SUCCESS) {\n\t\tLOG_ERR(\"Failed to acquire image with capture_type %d: %d\",\n\t\t\tcapture_type, res);\n\t}\n\n\treturn convert_rts_get_image_error_code(res);\n}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/903e4fcd-0251-4c23-b245-b5856bb66f78)",
